/// install `coreutils` via Homebrew). If you have a password-encrypted private key, you
/// can decrypt it using `openssl pkcs8 -in rsa_key_encrypted.p8 -out rsa_key.p8`. Also,
/// make sure fields such as the username are URL-encoded.
///
/// The [`gocosmos`](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/microsoft/gocosmos) driver is still
/// experimental, but it has support for [hierarchical partition
/// keys](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/hierarchical-partition-keys)
